    "title": "🎁 Freebies Up for Grabs in The Villages Right Now",
    "text": "3 hours ago Looking to pick up some free items around The Villages ? Neighbors are giving away everything from furniture to sports gear. Here are a few local finds you can claim today.\n98\" Google TCL TV A 98-inch TCL Google TV that unfortunately no longer powers on after a power surge. Could be useful for parts or repair. Pick up only in Lady Lake, FL . Purchased from Costco in November 2025. Condition: Used – Fair.\n👉 See this item on Facebook\nMoving Boxes If you’re packing up or organizing, grab these 3 large and 3 medium/large moving boxes . Available Saturday afternoon, 4/18 in Virginia Trace near Sumter .\n👉 See this item on Nextdoor\nGlass Patio Table A square glass patio table with a metal frame, 45\" wide x 35\" high , includes an umbrella hole and support. Located in Glenbrook/Polo . The owner is making room for a new table.\n👉 See this item on Nextdoor\nFounders Club Golf Set A complete golf set with bag and clubs by Founders Club . Perfect for anyone looking to start golfing or upgrade their gear. Located in The Village of Poinciana .\n👉 See this item on Nextdoor\nGolf Bag Rack & Dumbbell Rack Two handy storage pieces — a golf bag rack and a dumbbell rack . Both are used but in good condition . Available in The Villages .\n👉 See this item on Facebook\nFree items in The Villages tend to go fast, so if something catches your eye, reach out to the poster soon!\nPlease note: Availability changes quickly. Some items listed here may have already been claimed, and links may no longer be active. Contact the poster directly for the most up-to-date information.\nThis article includes content summarized and organized with AI tools, which can make mistakes. Learn more.",
